  "detail": {
    "description": "SHORT LET - John D Wood & Co in Primrose Hill would like to present The Vabel Haverstock which overlooks the intersection of some of London’s most iconic locales. The apartment is perfectly designed for the flow of modern life. An attractive and contemporary home with excellent proportions, plentiful natural light and a robust, raw and refined material palette. Situated on the first floor (with lift) the accommodation comprises: open-plan reception/kitchen with sliding floor to ceiling doors leading onto a private decked balcony; generously sized double bedroom with ample fitted storage; beautiful family bathroom with shower above bath and underfloor heating. The flat has wood floors throughout and is newly decorated. A communal roof terrace offering panoramic view across London, situate on the fourth floor and bike secure bike storage in the basement.",
